## How to Check (run these steps)

### 1. Pull real-time token usage from Cloud Monitoring API

```bash
curl -s -H "Authorization: Bearer $(gcloud auth print-access-token)" \
  -H "x-goog-user-project: itpc-ca-ef54c167b7" \
  "https://monitoring.googleapis.com/v3/projects/itpc-ca-ef54c167b7/timeSeries?filter=metric.type%3D%22aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count%22&interval.endTime=$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)&interval.startTime=$(date -u +%Y-%m-01T00:00:00Z)&aggregation.alignmentPeriod=2592000s&aggregation.perSeriesAligner=ALIGN_SUM&aggregation.crossSeriesReducer=REDUCE_SUM&aggregation.groupByFields=resource.labels.model_user_id&aggregation.groupByFields=metric.labels.type&pageSize=100" 2>&1
```

Parse with python3: model is in `resource.labels.model_user_id`, token type in `metric.labels.type`, count in `points[0].value.int64Value`.

### 2. Calculate cost using Vertex AI Global pricing (per MTok)

| Model | Input | Output | 5m Cache Write | Cache Read |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| claude-opus-4-8 | $5.00 | $25.00 | $6.25 | $0.50 |
| claude-opus-4-6 | $5.00 | $25.00 | $6.25 | $0.50 |
| claude-sonnet-5 | $2.00 | $10.00 | $2.50 | $0.20 |
| claude-sonnet-4-6 | $3.00 | $15.00 | $3.75 | $0.30 |
| claude-haiku-4-5 | $1.00 | $5.00 | $1.25 | $0.10 |

Token type mapping: `input` = Input, `output` = Output, `cache_write_input` = 5m Cache Write, `cache_read_input` = Cache Read.

### 3. Apply enterprise discount

Multiply total list-price cost by **0.74** (26% discount) to get estimated actual spend. Then subtract from $500 for remaining balance.

